  "release_notes": [
    "Preserved the full original package and added a hardened MCP runtime.",
    "Replaced fragile schema conversion and added typed state persistence.",
    "Expanded runtime tools for signal review, sales copy, state snapshot, media spec, venue scoring, routing context, KB sync, and strategy maps.",
    "Added vector_research_memo and research-weighted scoring inputs to reduce reliance on static heuristics.",
    "Added canonical nested runtime views for routing, product, ICP, distribution, risk, logs, session sync, and artifact registry.",
    "Strengthened phase guards and state transitions without removing original material.",
    "Added a basic design skill for launch-ready visual direction.",
    "Separated thesis and venue gate handling in the MCP runtime.",
    "Added an integration status registry, new platform adapters, and release checks that match the real repo layout."
  ]
